servable, such instrument is included in level 2. If the inputs used to determine the price are not observable, the instrument will be included in Level 3.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Fair Value level 3: If one or more significant inputs are not based on observable market data, the instrument is included in level 3.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Group's financial instruments measured at fair value as of December 31, 2020 and 2019 are detailed below:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Financial Instruments as of 12/31/2020                     FV level 1       FV level 2       FV level 3       Total        \par Assets                                                                                                                     \par - Cash and due from banks                                  -                -                -                -            \par - Debt securities at fair value through profit or loss     9,632,732        239,171          -                9,871,903    \par - Derivatives                                              143,944          -                -                143,944      \par - Other financial assets                                   3,407,891        -                -                3,407,891    \par - Other debt securities                                    6,353,196        28,181,585       -                34,534,781   \par - Financial assets pledged as collateral                   4,687,488        -                -                4,687,488    \par - Investments in Equity Instruments                        87,131           29,197           -                116,328      \par Total Assets                                               24,312,382       28,449,953       -                52,762,335   \par Liabilities                                                                                                                \par - Liabilities at fair value through profit or loss         2,002,005        -                -                2,002,005    