 of the French Development Agency, Such funds were immediately allocated among Small and Medium Size Companies Clients of our portfolio who run their businesses in regional exporting economies in different sectors,\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 F-86\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 GRUPO SUPERVIELLE S.A.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 As of December 31, 2020 presented in comparative format\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (Expressed in thousands of pesos)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 It is worth to be mentioned that such agreement is subject to the compliance of certain financial covenants, certain 'do and do not do' conditions as well as certain reporting requirements,\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 As of December 31, 2019, the Entity did not meet the non-performing loan ration nor the coverage, Therefore, on January 29, 2020, the Entity started the process to receive a waiver with BID, which was made effective on February 18, 2020, As a result of such waiver, BID waives its right to accelerate such debt resulting from the breach in non-performing loan ratios and coverage ratios over a period that started on October 1, 2019 and finished in December 31, 2019, Likewise, on April 16, 2020 new exemptions were requested thus extending the agreed terms until April 30, 2020,\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 On August 11, 2020, a new amendment was agreed that extends the agreed deadlines from May 1, 2020 to December 31, 2020,\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 As of December 31 and as of the date of issuance of these financial statements, the Bank was in compliance with the financial covenants of both loans.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 29. BUSINESS COMBINATIONS\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 - EASY CAMBIO S,A,\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 On October 16, 2020, the Group acquired 100% of the capital stock of Easy Cambio S,A, for a total price of $13,7 millons, a company authorized by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of the Argentine Republic as Exchange Agen