he credit risk, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operational\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  risk and market risk, Financial institutions (including their domestic Argentine and international branches) must comply with the minimum capital requirements both on an individual and a consolidated basis,\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The following table sets forth information regarding excess capital and selected capital and liquidity ratios of the Bank, consolidated with CCF:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 As stated above under 'Presentation of Financial and Other Information', we have prepared our audited consolidated financial statements for 2019, 2018 and 2017 under IFRS, Minimum capital requirement has been prepared in accordance with the rules of the Argentine \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which is not comparable to data prepared under IFRS.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2                                                                                              Year ended December 31,(2)                              \par                                                                                              2020                                                                     2019                  2018   \par                                                                                                                                                                                                    \par                                                                                              (in thousands of Pesos except percentages and ratios)   \par Calculation of excess capital:                                                                                                                                                                                      \par Allocated to assets at risk                                                                                                                          9,047,140                 7,164,842               6,090,341    \par Allocated to Bank premises and equipment, intangible assets and equity investment assets                                                             1,350,035                 826,133                 370,233      \par Market risk                                                                                                                                          551,765                   251,739                 301,724      \par Interest rate risk                                                                                                                                   -                         -                       -            \par Public sector and securities in investment account,                                                                                                  27,651                    11,472                  96,882       \par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Operational\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  risk                                                                                                                                     3,233,793                 2,349,952               1,486,516    \par Required minimum capital under \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rules                                                                                                    14,210,384                10,604,138              8,345,696    \par Basic net worth                                                                                                                                      30,242,263                16,991,091              11,847,865   \par Complementary net worth                                                                                                                              1,090,865                 1,033,734               1,163,939    \par Deductions                                                                                                       