\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Argentina to fall from emerging to border by trap to dollar stock exchange\b0\par\par\uc2 615 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Mai 2021\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 MSCI (Morgan Stanley Capital Investment) is a global market provider of nearly 100,000 daily market indices.\par \par \uc2 They are responsible for putting together a kind of financial ranking of countries, where today Argentina is among the emerging ones, which would be a kind of Primera B in football.\par \par \uc2 On the second Tuesday of June you must decide whether to send our country to relegation, that is to say to the border market, which is a kind of First C football\par \par \uc2 That's why MSCI is currently surveying the world's largest banks and investment funds by asking them what to do with Argentina.\par \par \uc2 In November, when they made this same consultation, it gave it a stay where it was, but a event occurred during the summer that set off the alarms: a new spot trap with liquidation.\par \par \uc2 In fact, the National Securities and Exchange Commission tried to disguise one news story with another: it celebrated that the car park would be lowered from two days to one so that it could buy dollars on the stock exchange.\par \par \uc2 But below all in the January circular, he said that cable \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  were limited to a maximum of 100,000 nominal \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , so no company or person could buy more than $38,000 per week through the liquidation. I mean, to send \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 What caused this news was barely released was an abrupt drop in the volume traded in the CCL, falling from $16 million per day to $5 million in the AL30c, which is the ticker of Argentina's Local Law 2030. But it also caused a fall in the \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the MEP dollar, as the AL30D fell from trading $30 million to $20 million per day.\par \par \uc2 For the time being, every second Tuesday in May in MSCI recalibrates indices: it was decided that it should leave MSCI Telecom and that between \uc2 Adecoagro\uc2 ; In addition, Central Puerto left MSCI's SmallCap, all events to be confirmed on May 27.\par \par \uc2 Currently only \uc2 Adecoagro\uc2 , Globant and \uc2 YPF\uc2  remain as emerging, of which it has 100% of the business in Argentina only \uc2 YPF\uc2 , but represents less than 10% of the index, so the MSCI of Argentina ceased to be fully representative.\par \par \uc2 What they say at the tables is that this is the anteroom to reclassification, since they cleaned up' all the quotes that were 100% local.\par \par \uc2 They find that Argentina will be reclassified and will be a major blow to Economy Minister \uc2 Mart\u237\'00\'EDn Guzm\u225\'00\'E1n\uc2  because the reason is because of the regulations to the cable dollar they imposed in the summer, which further limited the \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 While the City hopes that it will be good for some actions, the truth is that Argentina will fall a status that it managed to obtain years and many structural reforms.\par \par \uc2 "It would have been better to continue to have the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the liquidation cash market without letting \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  down," they reveal in the City of Buenos Aires.\par \par \uc2 They comment that while the measure was taken by the National Securities Commission, which is the regulatory body, the decision to do so was from the Ministry of the Economy, that is why they blame Guzman. In short, the CNV depends on the Mecon.\par \par \uc2 In fact, in MSCI's review last November about possible reclassifications, there was no intention of moving our country from place to place, as commented by Telegram by the connoisseurs of the metier, who prefer not to leave footprints on the WhatsApp on sensitive issues.\par \par \uc2 But the restriction of the nominal 100,000 was the drop that overflowed the glass.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020210513eh5c000jm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
