llion for the fiscal year ended December 31, 2019, compared to a net loss of US$54 million all of which are attributable to the owners of the Company.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Holding and Others Segment\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2                                            Fiscal year ended \par                                            December 31, 2019   December 31, 2018   Variation   % \par Revenue                                    20                  36                  (16)        (44%) \par Cost of sales                              -                   -                   -           - \par Gross profit                               20                  36                  (16)        (44%) \par                                                                                                \par Selling expenses                           (2)                 (4)                 2           (50%) \par Administrative expenses                    (22)                (27)                5           (19%) \par Other operating income and expenses, net   (1)                 9                   (10)        (111%) \par Share of profit from joint ventures        67                  92                  (25)        (27%) \par Operating income                           62                  106                 (44)        (42%) \par                                                                                                \par Results on net monetary position           -                   12                  (12)        (100%) \par Finance income                             5                   14                  (9)         (64%) \par Finance costs                              (4)                 (6)                 2           (33%) \par Other financial results                    (18)                108                 (126)       (117%) \par Financial results, net                     (17)                128                 (145)       (113%) \par Profit before income tax      