developed business relationships over the years with strategic companies from the oil and gas and the biofuel sectors, and in the past have participated in certain joint ventures with some of them.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Insurance\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 We carry commercial and personal insurance coverage for all power generation plants, placed at different geographical locations within Argentina. The following list includes all the insurance risk covered:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1.\f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Operational\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  All Risks- Including Material Damage & Machinery Breakdown and Business Interruption (Loss of Profits)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This coverage protects against unexpected events due to a sudden or accidental cause, including weather, fire and natural disasters, that may damage property or fixed assets (Material Damage); and Mechanical and Electrical breakdown events that may cause sudden and unforeseen physical loss or damage to machinery (Machinery Breakdown) that is \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operational\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ; any of which may damage our ability to generate power, including coverage for consequential Loss of Profits (Business Interruption) for a maximum period of 18 months.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 2.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Commercial General Liability\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This coverage protects against the claims from third parties arising out of bodily injury or death and property damage resulting from the insured activities including Premises, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Products and/or Completed \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . The coverage limit is up to US$ 10,000,000 per occurrence.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 3.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Commercial Excess Liability(CPSA only)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This coverage protects against the same risks described in the previous bullet point but covers 'in excess' of the coverage limit of the underlying primary insurance for a combined limit (concurrent in all locations) of up to US$50,000,000.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 4.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Port Operators Liability(CPSA only)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Covers CPSA\u180\'00\'B4s liability to third parties for Personal Injury or Property Damage as a result of an occurrence or event in connection with day to day Port Operator Activities.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 5.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Director and Officers Liability(CPSA only)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This policy covers individuals for claims made against them while serving on a board of directors and/or as an officer and it is payable to those directors and officers of a company, or to the organization(s) itself, as indemnification (or reimbursement) for losses or advancement of defense costs in the event an insured suffers such a loss as a result of a legal action brought for alleged wrongful acts in their capacity as directors and officers.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 6.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Motor Vehicle + Mobile Equipment\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 CPSA and its subsidiaries carry cover for all its fleet vehicles as well as trucks and mobile equipment for daily \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operation\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . The coverage goes from basic third-party liability in mobile equipment to Comprehensive Coverage in some cars (theft, fire, hail, vandalism, property and vehicle damage).\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 7.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Worker\u180\'00\'B4s Compensation\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This coverage provides wage replacement and medical benefits to employees injured in the course of employment and/or while commuting to and from work.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 8.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Compulsory Life Insurance\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This coverage is provided by the employer and guarantees the payment of a death benefit to named beneficiaries upon the death of the insured (employee).\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 9.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Optional Term Life Insurance\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This is an optional and additional coverage the employer pays over the basic Compulsory Life insurance in order to guarantee its employees the payment of 24 additional wages in case of death. This is part of an employee Benefits plan.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 10.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Ocean & Inland Transit All Risks(floating policy)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Transit Coverage for an annual period during all stages of transit and delivery, whether marine, on the dock, by air or inland transportation from anywhere in the world to anywhere within the argentine territory and vice versa. Premiums are paid monthly at an Ex-Post basis.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 11.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Commercial Business Combined\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This is a tailored policy to cover specifically the offices and warehouses owned by CPSA in the city of Neuqu\u233\'00\'E9n, Piedra del \u193\'00\'C1guila Town and Piedra del \u193\'00\'C1guila Hydroelectric Dam. This is a comprehensive business coverage in a single policy, bringing together a range of the covers: Employers' liability, Public liability, Product liability, Legal expenses, material damage and theft, Goods in transit and others.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 12.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Construction All Risks / Erection All Risks(CAR/EAR)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This is a non-standard policy that provides coverage for property damage and third-party injury or damage claims during construction projects. We carry this insurance every time we undertake a new construction.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 13.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Compulsory Environmental Pollution Insurance\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 This coverage protects against third party personal injury; third party property losses; ecological damage and costs incurred in provision of emergency services and environmental clean-up.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 We believe that the level of insurance and reinsurance coverage we maintain is reasonably adequate in the light of the risks we are exposed to and is comparable to the level of insurance and reinsurance coverage maintained by other similar companies doing business in the same industry.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Environment\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 As of the date of this annual report, we are not involved in pending or threatened judicial proceedings in connection with environmental issues.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 As of the date of this annual report, we have obtained or have applied for the environmental permits required by the applicable environmental regulations and our environmental management plans have been approved by the applicable regulatory authorities. To maintain high environmental standards, we carry out periodic controls in accordance with applicable legislation.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 We have developed a broad environmental compliance and management program, which is subject to periodic internal and external audits by T\u220\'00\'DCV Rheinland.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In July 2019, T\u220\'00\'DCV Rheinland completed a series of ISO recertification audits and we got the following certificates:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Standard: ISO 14001:2015\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Certificate Registr. No.: 01 10406 1629668\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Certificate Holder: Central Puerto S.A. Av. Tomas Edison 2701 Ciudad Aut\u243\'00\'F3noma de Buenos Aires Argentina\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Scope: Generation of electric energy from: hydraulic energy, termal energy (gaseous and liquid fuls), wind energy. Steam production.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Validity: The certificate es valid from 2019-07-13 until 2022-07-12\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Including the locations:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 No: Name/Location                                                                                       Scope\par 1   Central Planta Buenos AiresAv. Thomas Edison 2701Ciudad Aut\u243\'00\'F3noma de Buenos Aires                    Generation of electric energy from: termal energy (gaseous and liquid fuls).\pa