aw No. 25,675, any individual or legal entity, whether public or private, engaged in activities that endanger the environment, ecosystems and their constituent elements, including us, must carry insurance for an amount sufficient to cover the cost of repairing the damages such individual or legal entity may cause. We fully comply with this regulation.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Security and Health\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In managing occupational safety and health we seek to protect people and our own and third parties' property, assuming that:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \u9679\'25\'CF\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 all accidents and occupational diseases can be prevented;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \u9679\'25\'CF\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 compliance with applicable occupational and health standards is the responsibility of all individuals participating in activities in our facilities; and\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \u9679\'25\'CF\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 raising awareness among individuals contributes to the welfare at the workplace and to the improved individual and collective development of the members of the work community.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Our commitment to ongoing improvement compels us to review the sufficiency of our current policy and its stated goals on an ongoing basis to ensure conformance to the changes required by the market and the applicable laws.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In July 2019, T\u220\'00\'DCV Rheinland completed a series of ISO and OHSAS recertification audits and we got the following certificates:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Standard: ISO 9001:2015\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Certificate Registr. No.: 01 10006 1629668\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Certificate Holder: Central Puerto S.A. Av. Tomas Edison 2701 Ciudad Aut\u243\'00\'F3noma de Buenos Aires Argentina\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Scope: Generation of electric energy from: hydraulic energy, termal energy (gaseous and liquid fuls), wind energy.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Validity: The certificate es valid from 2019-07-13 until 2022-07-