bt ratio of no more than 3.75:1.00. Moreover, CPSA, under certain conditions, agreed to make capital contributions to subsidiary Vientos La Genoveva II S.A.U. Moreover, CPSA has agreed to maintain, unless otherwise consented to in writing by the lender, the ownership (directly or indirectly) and control over Vientos La Genoveva II S.A.U. As at December 31, 2020, the Company has complied with such obligations.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 On July 23, 2019, the loan funds were fully disbursed. As of December 31, 2020 and 2019, the balance of this loan amounts to 2,711,190 and 3,053,500, respectively.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 14.3.7.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Banco Macro S.A. short-term loan\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 On October 25 and 28, the Company entered into a loan agreement with Banco Macro S.A. for an amount of 1,000,000 to be used in the commercial business of the Company.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Under the terms of the agreement, this loan accrues a variable three-month interest rate based on pure BADLAR rate, plus a margin; and it is completely amortized in a year.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 On October 28, 2019, the loan funds were fully disbursed. As of December 31, 2019, the balance of this loan amounts to 1,521,951. On June 19, 2020, the balance of this loan was fully paid in advance.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 14.3.8.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Financial trust corresponding to Thermal Station Brigadier L\u243\'00\'F3pez\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Within the framework of the acquisition of Thermal Station Brigadier L\u243\'00\'F3pez, the Company assumed the capacity of trustor in the financial trust previously entered into by Integraci\u243\'00\'F3n Energ\u233\'00\'E9tica Argentina S.A., which was the previous owner of the thermal station. The financial debt balance at the transfer date of the thermal station was USD 154,662,725.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 According to the provisions of the trust agreement, the financial debt accrues an interest rate equal to the LIBO rate plus 5% or equal t