e (2000 GMT), against his all-time high of 1,669 units scored in early March since the reconfiguration of his base in september last.\par \par \uc2 * In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  segment, the wholesale weight depreciated by 0.29%, with an unusual difference in buy and sell between 92.23/92.27 per dollar, in a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  square (BCRA).\par \par \uc2 * The entity had a purchase balance of just over $65 million, operators said, after absorbing about $1.475 million the previous month. An official source of the entity argued that "the collapse of futures rates continues without the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ".\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's agricultural exports generated revenue of $2.774 million in March, a record for the past 18 years, the Oil Industry Chamber and the Grain Exporters Center (CIARA-CEC) said last Thursday.\par \par \uc2 * The weight in the alternative segments operated at 148.6 units in the stock market 'CCL', 141.85 in the 'MEP dollar', 140 units in the informal segment and 161.29 in the retail 'solidarity dollar'.\par \par \uc2 * Meanwhile, Argentine President \uc2 Alberto Fern\u225\'00\'E1ndez\uc2  recovers after positive for COVID-19 on Friday night.\par \par \uc2 (Report by Jorge Otaola; Additional report by Hern\u225\'00\'E1n Nessi; Edited by Walter Bianchi)\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020210405eh4500ix1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
