\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Argentine  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  absorbs about 1,475 mln dlr in March and sums fourth months of favorable  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 : operators\b0\par\par\uc2 646 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2021\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 By Jorge Otaola\par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES, 31 Mar (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BCRA) closed March with purchases of about $1.475 million through its share of the wholesale market, estimated operators on Wednesday and based on Reuters data, the highest monthly volume since November 2019.\par \par \uc2 Thus, the entity manages to accumulate four months with a positive balance in a system of hard exchange controls to curb reserve indentation and attack inflation. Originally, the figure yielded a balance of about $1.59 billion, which was then adjusted for inter-semanal changes.\par \par \uc2 This is the most relevant monthly absorption since he took over Alberto Fernandez's centre-left government in December 2019, and the largest since November of that year when BCRA acquired $2.2 billion.\par \par \uc2 March acquisitions, mainly from the agri-export sector, are added to the $1.398 million absorbed between December and February, after selling $4.882 billion between July and November, according to official data.\par \par \uc2 The bank ended 2020 with a negative balance of $4.169 million and posted sales of $3.182 billion in 2019.\par \par \uc2 Wholesale weight was devalued in March by 2.36%, to a historic floor of 91.99/92.00 units, after ceding 2.78% in the previous month and another 3.64% in the first month of the year, resulting in an 8.53% depreciation in the first quarter of 2021.\par \par \uc2 ABC Mercado de Change reported that "the volume (business journal) was high compared (to previous days), by the end of the month and the next holidays". The Argentine financial square will be closed until Monday, for the celebration of Easter.\par \par \uc2 BCRA sales on Wednesday were around $60 million, operators added.\par \par \uc2 Friday's "end-of-month positions close and intense official activity in all market segments" said Gustavo Quintana, operator of PR Exchange Brokers.\par \par \uc2 He added that in the month, the exchange rate had "the lowest (adjustment) since August last year."\par \par \uc2 The exchange rate gap against informal weight narrowed at the end of the first quarter of the year to 53.26%, when last October it grazed 160%.\par \par \uc2 Consultancy Analytica reported this week that reducing the monetary base allowed BCRA to contain the gap and accumulate \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but clarified that there are tensions in place amid investor uncertainty about the future of the domestic economy and that the official strategy is insufficient to lower inflation.\par \par \uc2 He noted that the monetary base went from increasing by 77% year-on-year in August before growing by 39% in last February.\par \par \uc2 The Government said it hopes to end the year with a 25% peso loss, facing budgeted inflation of 29%, although private analysts estimate that retail prices will soar above 45%.\par \par \uc2 These specialists agree that the BCRA fails to hoard the purchased dollars, but that the Government uses them to buy pesos through bonds in the stock market called 'liquidation' (CCL). In this way it obtains a reduction of weights in circulation and presses to try to lower the inflationary escalation.\par \par \uc2 The previous week, Economy Minister \uc2 Mart\u237\'00\'EDn Guzm\u225\'00\'E1n\uc2  publicly confirmed that the public sector sells dollars to the 'CCL', but that it does not sell bonds net in the secondary market.\par \par \uc2 The strategy is to anchor the wholesale exchange rate and contain the gap through \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the bond market, i.e. a virtual exchange rate unfolding, added specialists consulted by Reuters, at a time when the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues with the slowdown in the pace of the daily devaluation of the official exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 The BCRA's policy of using the dollars acquired in the wholesale round to supply the 'CCL' square via asset business, has almost no impact on international reserves and contracts the monetary base.\par \par \uc2 (Report by Jorge Otaola; Additional report by Hern\u225\'00\'E1n Nessi; Edited by Walter Bianchi)\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020210331eh3v00ppe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
