\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Argentine financial square closes short for debt redemption and \uc2 IMF\b0\par\par\uc2 569 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Dezember 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 (Updates exchange \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  data)\par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES, Dec 15 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's assets closed low on Tuesday, in a selective place of business given the investment prudence for the future of the domestic economy, in a market awaiting the outcome of a new debt exchange and expecting signs of dealings with the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  for an extended facility agreement.\par \par \uc2 The exchange called by the Ministry of economy aims to convert letters into pesos and others in the same inflation-adjusted \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  (CER), into sovereign bonds in dollars under local law by 2030 (-AL30-) and 2035 (-AL35-).\par \par \uc2 "The focus is still on negotiations with the \uc2 IMF\uc2 , which (Economy Minister Martin) Guzman says are moving forward, albeit without speed," said Javier Rava, analyst at Rava Burs\u225\'00\'E1til.\par \par \uc2 He added that this is "important because they are one of the main expectations that the market expects, since a guideline of objectives in the focus of a balance and order of the economy is inevitable to show strength and necessary certainty."\par \par \uc2 * Sovereign bonds in the local over-the-counter market fell by an average of 0.4%, where the reference title 'Bonar 30' lost 0.8%.\par \par \uc2 * "At these levels dollar sovereign bonds continue to exhibit low parities, reflecting investors' caution at the status of macroeconomic and fiscal imbalances that remain present at the domestic level. In the meantime, investor focus will continue on the evolution of talks with the \uc2 IMF\uc2 ," said settlement and clearing agent Puente.\par \par \uc2 * The country risk of Argentina, as measured by THE JP bank. Morgan, he was up nine units, to 1,379 basic points by 17.00 local time (2000 GMT).\par \par \uc2 * Leading stock index S&P; Merval improved by 0.46%, at an average close of 53,280.19 units, due to selective portfolio recompositions after losing 1.47% in the previous session.\par \par \uc2 * The weight in the interbank square depreciated by a slight 0.1%, at 82.53/82.54 per dollar, with liquidity regulation from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  with purchases or dollar sales of its reserves.\par \par \uc2 * Market sources estimated that the monetary entity would have ended up with a positive balance of $156 million for its reserves in its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the day, having bought about $145 million from the market in the previous four days.\par \par \uc2 * So far in December the positive net for the BCRA almost exceeds $100 million, commented Gustavo Quintana, operator of PR Corredores de Cambio.\par \par \uc2 "We don't see that in the medium to long term the stock market situation has improved, but if the 'financial veranito' is likely to be extended until February, based on three factors: a good global context, an increase in demand for money, and an increase in seasonal demand for money," said Roberto Geretto, cmF Bank economist.\par \par \uc2 * The alternative dollar called 'Counted with Settlement' (CCL) in the stock market square depreciated to 144 pesos, while the 'MEP dollar' of the Electronic Open Market (MAE) stood at 141.8 pesos and in the parallel market ended up stable at 151 pesos, in a small place of business.\par \par \uc2 * Alternative dollars "continue to rebound in the face of the growing perception of lowering among operators, after loosening heavily from highs in a climate of higher inflation," said Gustavo Ber, economist at the consultancy Studio Ber.\par \par \uc2 (Report by Walter Bianchi Additional Report by Hern\u225\'00\'E1n Nessi Edited by Jorge Otaola)\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020201215egcf00985\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
