\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Argentine peso maintains controlled fall with  \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 535 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Dezember 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES, 1 Dec (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's wholesale weight and exchange rate in alternative markets began December with a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 -controlled devaluation (BCRA) and \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by official entities to prevent further loss of value, operators said Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 They added that the monetary entity keeps its sights on the level of liquidity in a month that, out of seasonality, companies require more pesos for the payment of the aguinaldo medium, which would help it to further curb the bleeding of its hit international reserves.\par \par \uc2 "The exchange rate gap is around 78/83% - below the 120/130% highs reached in October. However, the gap remains at still very high levels by forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to maintain \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales to contain the pace of devaluation of the wholesale exchange rate," said portfolio personal investment brokerage.\par \par \uc2 Argentina is in negotiations with the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  (\uc2 IMF\uc2 ) to postpone maturities of a $44 billion loan in an economy hit by the coronavirus pandemic.\par \par \uc2 The Nation's Senate, with 65 votes in favor and none against, averaged Monday night's penalty on the "Law for the Sustainability of Public Debt" bill. The draft states that the budget law must establish the maximum percentage to be issued in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and under foreign law with respect to the total authorized issues.\par \par \uc2 * Wholesale weight lost a slight 0.11%, at 81.39/81.40 per dollar at 12.50 local time (1550 GMT), after BCRA sold $325 million from its reserves in November to bring the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down by 3.66%. Thus, it supplied private demand, payment of imports and financial debt of companies.\par \par \uc2 * "Sales are significantly lower than those recorded in recent months (...) The combination of measures that stimulated \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  settlement with mechanisms introduced to order the payment of imports and corporate debts led to the exchange market and improved the outlook," said a BCRA source.\par \par \uc2 * The Chamber of The Oil Industry of Argentina (CIARA) and the Center for Cereal Exporters (CEC), entities representing 40% of Argentine exports, announced that during the last month companies in the sector liquidated $1,734.3 million, higher by 1.1% compared to October. What has been settled since the beginning of the year amounts to $18,583.6 million.\par \par \uc2 * In alternative squares, where the ANSES forecasting body generally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to contain prices, the peso dropped by 0.7% to 149.1 per dollar in the 'Counted with Settlement' (CCL) stock market and 0.5% to 145.3 per unit in the 'MEP dollar' of the Electronic Open Market (MAE). In the small marginal market it remained stable at 155 units.\par \par \uc2 * Over-the-counter debt rose 0.4% on average, after earning 5.3% over the previous month, against a jp bank country risk. Morgan down four units to 1,407 basic points, similar to the levels of the first week of November.\par \par \uc2 * In turn, the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange's S&P; Merval index rose 0.95%, to 55,092.64 units, led by financial and energy stocks, after advancing by 20.5% in November.\par \par \uc2 (Report by Jorge Otaola, Additional Report by Hern\u225\'00\'E1n Nessi. Edited by Eliana Raszewski)\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020201201egc10069x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
