\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Guzman's nod to Pesce on dollar control\b0\par\par\uc2 640 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 November 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 Economy Minister Mart\u237\'00\'EDn Guzm\u225\'00\'E1ndetailed on Wednesday that the stock of reserves held by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , free of bank lace, reaches $28.365million to date and flatly derailed the use of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  deposited by financial institutions. The official made this clarification before a senator's consultation during his presentation by the Upper House Budget Committee on the bill to prohibit the Executive from taking up debt and agreeing to fund the Monetary Fund without congressional authorization.\par \par \uc2 He also referred to the hedge funds that entered the country during the macrism to speculate on carry trade and now push on the exchange rate. The official considered "central to the ordering of the Argentine economy and part of the roadmap for more permanent sustainability". He spinning the course of indebtedness, which generated "$37.7 billion relief in the coming years," as it progresses in a program with the \uc2 IMF\uc2  to refinance lending to the country.\par \par \uc2 "Theissue of debt in the form of government securities is over and we are now with the \uc2 IMF\uc2 ; and we always maintained is that sustainability must be a state policy. That's why the Nation's Congress needs to play a more important role in strengthening debt sustainability," he said.\par \par \uc2 The initiative sent to the Senate determines in its first article that "the General Budget Act of the National Administration for each financial year shall provide for a maximum percentage for the issuance of government securities in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and under foreign law and jurisdiction with respect to the total amount of public securities issues authorized for that financial year".\par \par \uc2 In its second article, it provides that "any financing program or public credit \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  carried out with the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  (\uc2 IMF\uc2 ), as well as any extension of the amounts of those programs or \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , will require a law" of Congress "that expressly approves it". "Thestatus of programmes with the \uc2 IMF\uc2  is also placed because it has consequences thattranscend governments," Guzman added.\par \par \uc2 Debt versus weights\par \par \uc2 Consultations by opposition senators focused on the bimonthly situation of the Argentine economy. As for the level of BC reserves available to sustain the exchange rate, the minister noted that the figure is "$28.365 billion". "Those are lace-free. There is also the Chinese swap, the Fund's SDs and the gold. They are liquid even though they all have different degrees of liquidity that deserve different levels of analysis," Guzman said. In lace there are $11.158 million,which ensured "not used" to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market.\par \par \uc2 The minister further stated that "today \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a robust commercial surplus with seasonality month and month and with swings day by day". "There are no substantial debt payments for restructuring and capital control with relative effectiveness to contain the pressures that can be seen on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  front for financial reasons," said the owner of the Palace of Finance accompanied by Finance Secretary Diego Bastourre and Argentine representative to the IMF, Sergio Chodos.\par \par \uc2 With regard to negotiations with the Fund, he assured that the project proposing Congress' endorsement for debt-taking "facilitates an agreement with the agency" and assured that, "in dialogue with ministers from the G20 countries, the initiative has been very well received because it gives legitimacy to the process". Guzman reiterated that he will submit "tocongressional consideration the agreement with the Fund and the economic team will be on hand to explain whether we consider that what is agreed is aligned with the health of the country."\par \par \uc2 With reference to the issuance of debt in indexed pesos, the Minister of Economy said it seeks to "strengthen borrowing in pesos with peso returns." "There is a positive net voluntary pessification. There is a section that was nominated in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that went into national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," concluded Guzman.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020201119egbi0007g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
