\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 More trap is no solution\b0\par\par\uc2 959 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 September 2020\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs no more \b \highlight22\uc2 interventionism\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but regains confidence through a coherent plan that turns its vicious circles into virtuousThe functioning of an economy has an inexorable rule: when you try to solve a problem by attacking its consequences and not its causes, not only does it not solve it, but add new problems. A second rule: if difficulties are expected to resolve themselves, the damage caused to society will be more destructive than if their solution is properly designed. And in an unscheduled process in which the facts are not foreesed, the most harmed will be those with the least capacity to defend themselves against harm.Recent exchange and financial measures are unaware of these rules. Persistent drainage of \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves causes loss of confidence. The government's ability to correct the structural problems of our economy is not believed.\par \par \uc2  Moreover, every step he has taken since his assumption, on 10 December 2019, has been counterceding to the direction indicated by common sense.This fundamental failure should not be attributed to the pandemic, but to a vision of the problems overshadowed by retrograde ideologisms and to a management that favors obtaining judicial impunity for corruption during the previous management of those who now govern. For the latter there is a carefully crafted plan, while there is no plan for economic management.The presentation of the 2021 budget confirms this shortcoming gradually that the poor coherence and unrealism of its assumptions will be analysed. There is no confidence in the Government's ability to resolve the serious economic situation. A \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  issuance is observed in unreleased magnitudes, which even the most layman foreshadows higher inflation. The data show that the highest weight retention during quarantine for a few weeks is being reversed to apply to consumption, but in a significant share, to dollar savings.The philosophy of these exchange-change measures has been to try to correct the problems of the trap with more trap and also to transfer the costs to the private sector. This is clear for companies that need \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  to comply with credit services taken in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . They will no longer be able to do so with the official exchange relationship with which they export or the one governing the imports with which they must compete. They now warn that a step has been taken towards the unfolding of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, as the facts will have to use a strong dollar for the cancellation of its debts abroad. The Government requires restructuring maturities and, if not, will not sell dollars for that purpose. It will not be easy for companies to renegotiate with their creditors, which will be inevitable for those who do not want or cannot meet their payments at a substantially higher exchange rate. The detrimental impact this measure will have on trust can be understood. It's the opposite of what it takes to correct the causes of the problem.The purchase of $200 per month for savings has not been abolished, but purchases in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by credit card will be deducted from the quota from now on and a 35% advance in income tax has been incorporated. Thus, along with the tourist tax, it takes the cost of a dollar to 131 pesos. Even if the tax could be recovered, this seemed to the government enough to discourage purchases from the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . However, any increase in the quote on the informal market will make it interesting to buy dollars from the reserves again. This increase has already begun.When the same good has two different prices in the same place, naturally people and companies try to buy it at the lowest price andsell it to the major. The same goes for the dollar, and this applies not only to personal purchases to save - it would be leaking - but also to business \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Underbilled exports or overbilled imports, as well as export smuggling and other mischief, cannot be avoided. The trade balance vanishes at the same time as a breeding ground for corruption is generated, and we know the propensity for these vices of those who now rule.For companies that adhere to ethical rules, this scenario is extremely daunting. They may desist from investing and, more seriously, from operating in the country that imposes these practices. It is no coincidence that so many major companies are deciding to withdraw from Argentina.Prevention and combat against covid-19 has led to costs. It has also happened in other countries. But the economic and social consequences have been substantially more serious in Argentina. Macroeconomic imbalances. particularly fiscal spending multiplied between 2002 and 2015, when public spending increased from 39% to 46% of GDP. Neither this overflow, nor a deforming labor legislation, nor the tangle of regulations, nor the suffocating tax pressure could be properly corrected in Macri's management.Overcoming it through structural reforms is now a necessary but not sufficient condition for regaining confidence. Added to this should be an improvement in legal certainty characterized by a genuine division of powers, effective combat of drug trafficking and greater guarantees for personal security. From the highest levels of government, unrestricted respect for property law should be demonstrated and not reversed, as has been the case. If all this had an execution principle within an orderly plan, confidence would resurface and the current vicious circles would become virtuous. Then the president of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not have to appeal to one or be distressed by his reserves. When so many measures undermine the building of the trust needed to bring the stage back, citizens wonder whether it is gross impericiate or whether other unconfessable targets move our rulers.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020200919eg9j0027c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
