\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Federal Justice asked the Government for a report on the agreement with the \uc2 IMF\uc2  and the rise of the dollar after the STEPS\b0\par\par\uc2 895 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 September 2019\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 Commodator Py (Adrian Escandar)Justice today asked the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  (\uc2 IMF\uc2 ) for details of the agreement that was signed in 2018, its amendments and who Argentine officials \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  were. He also called on the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  to specify the schedules and travel made by \uc2 Guido Sandleris\uc2  and former economic portfolio holder \uc2 Nicol\u225\'00\'E1s Dujovne\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The order was signed on Tuesday by federal judge Rodolfo Canicoba Corral,in line with the measures that prosecutor Paloma Ochoa had requested on Wednesday of last week when he asked to advance the case.\par \par \uc2 This is an investigation to clarify whether the Government favoured the exchange rate run after the STEPS. The Justice seeks to know whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  intentionally let the dollar rise on the Monday after the primary elections on the instructions of \uc2 Mauricio Macri\uc2 , causing "a sharp degradation of the peso that shifted to prices and affected the value of the bonds of the State."\par \par \uc2 He also asked to investigate whether there was market manipulation on the Friday before the election, with an electoral objective, to provoke a fictitious rise in official publicly traded papers.\par \par \uc2 Nicolas Dujovne\uc2  and \uc2 Guido Sandleris\uc2  with IMF technician Roberto CardarelliThe complaint \u8211\'20\'13based by the Peace and Climate Change Foundation \u8211\'20\'13raised that on August 12, a day after the election, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  behaved "abnormal, strange and unusually" against the sharp rise of the dollar.\par \par \uc2 That day the BCRA decided not to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange market and let the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rise, the whistleblower says, "to an unsuspected ceiling." By the Monday after the STEPS the dollar went bankable 57.30 pesos and by Wednesday it had reached 62 pesos.\par \par \uc2 According to the complainant, "the BCRA was running from the operating table with complete clarity and the exchange rate had an abrupt rise that generated a strong degradation of the weight that shifted to prices and affected the value of government bonds."\par \par \uc2 His presentation mentions the radio statements of Mart\u237\'00\'EDn Redrado,former president of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , stating that it was President Macri who ordered the BCRA not to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market.\par \par \uc2 Federal Justice asked the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  for reports (Maximiliano Luna)"The President said Monday 'that the dollar goes where it needs to go so that Argentines learn who they voted for; and for having voted more devaluation and more inflation,'"he said. Pointing to the BCRA headline, \uc2 Guido Sandleris\uc2 , he added: "The BCRA was watching from the stands what was going on in the market rather than \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 Prosecutor Ochoa reviewed the terms of the complaint stating that such action would not only have violated the Organic Charterof the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  that prevents receiving orders or indications from the Executive, but also the regulations of the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2 , because it argues that no country will be able to use the money delivered to deal with "a considerable or continuous outflow of capital".Finally, the opinion referred to the complainant's request that "without further clarification" it states that on Friday, August 9, before the STEPS, there was "a manipulation of the market with an electoral objective promoted by the President of the Nation which consisted in raising artificially the price of publicly traded papers and shares that the National Securities Commission should have investigated what happened."\par \par \uc2 Federal Judge Rodolfo Canicoba Corral (Adri\u225\'00\'E1n Escandar)Now, Canicoba Corral made room for the measures claimed by the prosecution. There are different information requirements for the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \uc2 IMF\uc2 , the Chief of Staff and the National Securities Commission.\par \par \uc2 As Infobae could tell, it asked the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  for details of the \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  carried out on 12 August, to individualize the actors involved, quantities and prices. The list of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and quotes. Also the digital list of \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the wholesale exchange market between September 10, 2018 and the same date of 2019 inclusive. It also requested lists of authorities, BCRA organizational charts and the official and travel agendas of Sandleris and other participating officials.\par \par \uc2 The holder of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 Guido Sandleris\uc2  (Maximiliano Luna)The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  also asked the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  for copies of the \uc2 IMF\uc2  agreements and their amendments since 2018 and the respective letters of intent. He also demanded the travel and schedules of Dujovne and the officials who \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 IMF\uc2 , meanwhile, asked it \u8211\'20\'13 through the Chancellery \u8211\'20\'13 to send a copy of the agreements with the Argentine state and its amendments since 2018, the meetings that the agency held with Argentine officials (with the details of the people who objective and whether meetings were held in connection with the amendments made by the Argentine State to its State policies). He also wanted to know if there were meetings of the \uc2 IMF\uc2  board.\par \par \uc2 The Cabinet Headquarters was asked to register income and income at Casa Rosada and BCRA on 12 August.\u160\'00\'A0And to the National Securities Commission, whether alerts or summaries were presented with the behaviour of the listed companies on the stock market or their traders between 8 and 13 August.\par \par \uc2 I kept reading:\par \par \uc2 Public debt fell to $307 billion, the lowest level in two years\par \par \uc2 The Government would authorize the purchase of up to $152,000 to purchase a first home\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020190917ef9h0057l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
