\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Argentina investigateif Macri has suddenly encouraged the dollar's rise\b0\par\par\uc2 370 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 September 2019\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 Stella CalloniPeri\u243\'00\'F3dico Newspaper Correspondent The DaySaturday, September 14, 2019, p. 20Buenos Aires., Federal prosecutor Paloma Ochoa decided yesterday to open a criminal case to investigate whether President \uc2 Mauricio Macri\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the dollar shot and the mega-devaluation that occurred a day after his defeat in the 11th August in front of the opposition Front of All, who was held accountable with the voters who gave him the win, of the consequences that would come if they won definitively, because of the fear of the markets for a new government led by Peronism.\par \par \uc2 The investigation is aimed at determining whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BCRA) did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on the orders of the government, a move that is considered a violation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's organic charter. The judge in charge will be Rodolfo Canicoba Corral, who must ask for reports on the agreement with the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  (\uc2 IMF\uc2 ), which would have pledged to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a circumstance such as the one that happened with $250 million per day, if the dollar exceeded 51.45 pesos.\par \par \uc2 The BCRA did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 On August 12, the dollar reached 63 and up to 66 Argentine pesos, deepening the economic crisis that was underway. Analysts warned that this alleged maneuver by the government of the Cambiamos alliance was going to backfire, as the government was hit more than its main opponent, stripping a crisis that concealed all the powerful means that deshaded systematically to shield the representative the United States considers its greatest associate in the south.\par \par \uc2 The cause was opened by Fernando M\u237\'00\'EDguez's denunciation of the Peace and Climate Change Foundation, referring to that dollar hike that began to float creating a real earthquake in the country and in the world, while the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BCRA) , which had always \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in similar situations \u8211\'20\'13 never to this extent \u8211\'20\'13 remained on the sidelines.\par \par \uc2 Former \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president Mart\u237\'00\'EDn Redrado publicly argued that Macri said that the dollar should go where it needs to go and that Argentines learn to vote and that BCRA executives were instructed to run from the market.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020190914ef9e002mo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
