\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Argentine peso steady after further controls, dips in black market\b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 September 2019\par 16:46\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2019 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds black market peso rate, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES, Sept 12 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso was steady on Thursday morning at around 56.2 per U.S. dollar after the country announced further control measures to protect the embattled \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , though it dipped in the unofficial black market.\par \par \uc2 Argentina's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  late on Wednesday announced measures requiring anyone buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to present a sworn oath promising to wait at least five days before using it to purchase bonds, closing a loophole that had allowed people to turn a quick profit.\par \par \uc2 The gap between the official spot rate and the black market rate widened, however, on Thursday morning with traders quoting the unofficial price down 1.26% to 59.75 per dollar. The gap is a sign people think the spot price is artificially high.\par \par \uc2 Traders said on Thursday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was offering dollars in the market from its reserves to shore up the peso, which lost a quarter of its value in August after a shock landslide primary election defeat for President \uc2 Mauricio Macri\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Argentina authorized \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls earlier this month after the peso plunge, an about-face by President \uc2 Mauricio Macri\uc2 , who had previously lifted many protectionist practices of his predecessor, \uc2 Cristina Fernandez de Kirchner\uc2 . (Reporting by Adam Jourdan and Walter Bianchi; Editing by Andrew Heavens) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2019-9-12T15:46:07.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020190912ef9c02o55\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
