\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 The five points to understand argentina's new change control\b0\par\par\uc2 1,050 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 September 2019\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 Instead of distinguishing itself from rival Cristina de Kirchner as an alternative to avoid ingenuity, Macri takes similar measures. (PanAm Post Photomontage)Starting Monday, September 2, Argentines will have to ask permission to buy dollars. Two months to go until the elections and President \uc2 Mauricio Macri\uc2  signed a decree imposing limits on the purchase of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and outrage was unleashed over the return of a measure imposed by his predecessor, who now ran for the vice presidency, \uc2 Cristina Fern\u225\'00\'E1ndez de Kirchner\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 After the STEPS, the primary presidential election, the threat of the return of Kirchnerism caused a collapse in markets and the loss of the value of the peso against the dollar. With which, the Argentines went to the banks to withdraw their savings or, to kill them.\par \par \uc2 To curb this phenomenon, through the DNU (Decree of Need and Urgency) 609/2019, now the limit to buy dollars per month is 10,000. This compares to the exchange rate trap imposed by its predecessor who is now seeking to return to power.\par \par \uc2 Macri rose to power and the first thing he did was revoke the change control that CFK imposed just days after assuming the presidency, in October 2011 and progressively increased until 2015. It imposed 15 restrictions on the purchase of dollars and consumption, even outside the country, requiring citizens to have authorization from the tax collection authority: AFIP. While the current limit is on the maximum purchase and not on the extraction or consumption.\par \par \uc2 With the dollar hovering around 60 pesos, the purchase limit amount would be 600,000 pesos. So the measure would not affect the bulk of the population, more considering that the minimum wage is 12,500 pesos per month; that is, the maximum amount exceeds 48 times.\par \par \uc2 What to understand:\par \par \uc2 Until now, the absence of "banking trap" was the only hallmark that the Macri government held with Kirchnerism. They're back in the way of agricultural withholdings last year. There is no strong economic differentiation to show, compared to elections where they were marked as an alternative to the above.The news was announced on the same day that the most anticipated football match of the year, Boca \u8211\'20\'13 River, was played. It had been said that on Monday there was going to be news and that the senators would know beforehand, but the news appeared in the media before the Argentine superclassic to de-hide it.Although the UND has a deadline of December this year, it is possible that if the situation is not in place, the deadline will be extended. This is often the case in \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  with all the strong \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the state in the economy. VAT at 21% in the 90s was to be temporary, the check tax also, the same with social plans, etc., which means that the temporary deadline will not be met.It is worth noting the institutional breakup involved in the measure, since the decree restores to the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the Argentine Republic the power to approve or to fail the purchase/sale of dollars. Faculty that had been taken away from him by lifting the previous government's trap. So it's much easier to restrict amounts and transactions now. And although the amount they determined now, $10,000 per month doesn't affect the bulk of the population, a pandora's box opens, because the number could change from 10,000 to 100.It's news again.the parallel dollar, known as the blue dollar; name that arises during Kirchnerism, is now back on everyone's lips. The informal dollar was already almost even lyfore d'olading with the banks, now one official price will emerge and another will emerge on the black market.Exporters must also settle \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  for their exports to the local market within five business days (maximum) after collection or 180 days after the boarding permit and 15 days for commodities.\par \par \uc2 Summary of measures\par \par \uc2 Posted by Agust\u237\'00\'EDn Etchebarne on Sunday, September 1, 2019\par \par \uc2 PanAm Post consulted with economist Roberto Cachanosky on this subject and explains that:\par \par \uc2 "When quantitative restrictions are made to the purchase of a good at a maximum price, it is because it is being rationed by quantity. This happens when you put a maximum price on any merchandise. Every maximum price is always put below the market price. No one puts a maximum price at the same price as the market or above the price at which the market operates.\par \par \uc2 Since the offer of the good in question does not reach that artificially low price, in this case the dollars, the decision of governments is to ration by quantity. It is the same as when you put a maximum price on toilet paper and then it is established that each person cannot carry more than four rolls per purchase. Here a maximum amount of dollars is set to be purchased per month for each individual and the shift official will decide how much you authorize to buy from the companies. The obligation to enter grain export \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a short time will cause the producer to retain more grains to save on grains that are dollars. So exports can decrease and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  income from exports to be lower than expected by adding more exchange rate tensions to existing ones."\par \par \uc2 Now is growing expectations of how this UND will affect the local economy and this, in turn, the presidential elections that are coming, where the current representative participates as an alternative to the return of the allies of Raul Castro and Nicol\u225\'00\'E1s Maduro, but instead to highlight the differences he has with them to excel, he adopts similarities.\par \par \uc2 Note elaborated in collaboration with Marcelo Duclos.\par \par \uc2 The power of journalism. The importance of truth.Your contribution makes it all possible!When we started the PanAm Post to try to bring the truth about Latin America to the rest of the world, we knew it would be a big challenge. But we were rewarded for the incredible amount of support and feedback from readers that made us grow and improve.\par \par \uc2 Be part of the mission to spread the truth! Help us fight attempts to silence dissident voices and contribute today.\par \par \uc2 Contribute today!\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020190902ef92003kw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
