\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Argentine  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  cuts interest rate and extends  \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Juli 2019\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BCRA) said on Monday that it set up a 58% interest rate flat for July and ratified until the end of the year the limits to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market at 39,755 and 51,448 pesos perdollar, in an attempt to slowly reactivate the economy without softening high inflation.\par \par \uc2 For June, the reference rate for the letters 'Leliq' was 62.5%. "The exchange rate \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy announced in April for the April-June period extends to the month of July. That is, the BCRA will not make exchange market purchases and will be able to make sales to counter episodes of excessive volatility, inside and outside the reference area," the monetary entity said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 Private analysts project annualized inflation at around 57% over the past 12 months. Through the Monetary Policy Committee (Copom), the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  decided to reduce the minimum cash requirement on fixed-term deposits by 3 percentage points.\par \par \uc2 This decision, according to the entity, represents a reduction of approximately 45 billion pesos (about 1.071 million dollars). "The Copom believes that the strict control of monetary aggregates carried out by the BCRA will continue to guide the disinflation process in the coming months," the monetary entity added in a statement.\par \par \uc2 Julio has a high seasonality of the demand for circulator in Argentina, as a result of the collection of aguinaldos (half an additional salary) and expenses associated with the winter break.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Argentine \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  entry cuts interest rate and extends \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was first published in La Tercera.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020190701ef71003c8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
