\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Necessary, but volatile\b0\par\par\uc2 653 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Mai 2019\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 What is the government of \uc2 Mauricio Macri\uc2  looking for with the agreement on 10 points proposed to the opposition?\par \par \uc2 In the main, that the leaders of the opposition declare the commitment to fulfill "the obligations with the creditors". That is the main point; on the others there are marked coincidences.\par \par \uc2 This happens in the midst of insistent analysis that it will be necessary to renegotiate the agreement with the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  (\uc2 IMF\uc2 ) -either the elected president- and the temptation of the Kirchner to declare a unilateral moratorium on the debt for one or two years.\par \par \uc2 It was M\u225\'00\'E1ximo Kirchner who opened the door to what markets and investors fear. "I'm not interested in the humor of the financial markets and the \uc2 IMF\uc2 ; they will have to wait, "the son of the former president said at the launch of a multi-party front. Obvious, anti-Fund.\par \par \uc2 In her book, Cristina Fern\u225\'00\'E1ndez already showed signs that her preferred external ally is \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2  more than the global order that emerges from the big financial centers, under the influence of the United States.\par \par \uc2 Can there be a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange before the elections? "We do not imagine that scenario, but a lot of volatility around the dollar," says An\u237\'00\'EDbal Casas Arregui, financial advisor and head of S & C Alic.\par \par \uc2 The mention of an eventual consensus around 10 key issues triggered Argentine actions on Wall Street and in the local market. Beyond the signing of this document, there are coincidences that the country must maintain the current agreement with the \uc2 IMF\uc2 , even if it is necessary to go from a stand by to an extended facilities agreement (EFF). This type of agreement requires structural reforms.\par \par \uc2 It would be something like returning to the promises of the proclaimed tax, labor and social security reforms, in addition to keeping the deficit zero in primary expenses.\par \par \uc2 Is the agreement proposed by \uc2 Mauricio Macri\uc2  possible? Very difficult in electoral times-less than 100 days for the primaries-in addition to playing against the background of the President and Chief of Staff, Marcos Pe\u241\'00\'F1a, who disbelieve political and economic agreements. They did not try them in more than 40 months of management.\par \par \uc2 Only the rise of the dollar and the fear of the collapse of the bonds, which are fueling the rise in country risk, placed them in the face of heresy.\par \par \uc2 A sacrilege that also committed the \uc2 IMF\uc2  on the free floating of the coins, essential principle of its postulates. Free floating sets the value of countries' \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in relation to their productivity and reputation, the theory argues.\par \par \uc2 But the fear of another populist government settling in the region and reproducing the image of Venezuela - with a strong Russian and Chinese presence - forced Donald Trump and his technicians to play all their influences for the Fund to put aside the libretto and assume that "sometimes" it is necessary for the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the free quotation of the dollar. More so in a bimonetary country like \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and with elections in sight.\par \par \uc2 Beyond the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the Central, the price of the dollar will remain volatile from here until the assumption of the new government. Economists agree that there are slight signs of recovery. Economic activity recovered in the inter-monthly comparison, and, after several months of sharp decline, the tax collection of April -51.3 percent more than in the same month of 2018- would approach the inflation of the last 12 months, that would be around 55 percent.\par \par \uc2 Retail sales still do not improve, after 15 consecutive months of decline. In certain points of the interior, the situation of the retailers is desperate. However, the Chamber of Commerce of Cordoba stressed that in the latest survey more optimists were assumed about the expectations tofuture.\par \par \uc2 There are still long months of interrelation between politics and economics, and vice versa.\par \par \uc2 Advertising\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020190504ef54001n8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
