\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 After four months of peace, the dollar is again shot in  \highlight22\uc2 Argentina \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 641 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Februar 2019\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to go out to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  so that the North American \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not pierce the flotation band. (\uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) The price of the North American \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was no longer the main concern in Argentina. After the last shocks and the change of authorities of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  a flotation band was stipulated and the dollar was circling within the margins expected by the Government of \uc2 Mauricio Macri\uc2 . The authorities had confirmed that there would be no \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  as long as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was quoted between 34 pesos minimum and 44 maximum.\par \par \uc2 But inflation in January, which was well above official expectations, once again increased the uncertainty about the Argentine economy and the US \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which had been going around between 36 and 38 pesos, jumped to 41.30, which turning on the alarms.\par \par \uc2 The economic team was very clear that the "exchange rate" was not absolutely guaranteed, and a peak near the top margin of the band can generate a new run. It should be noted that the last time went from 30 to 40 in a very short time and the rates of poverty and inflation suffered serious setbacks. As soon as the dollar had crossed the barrier of 40, the newspaper headlines were already wondering if there was a possibility of a new bullfight that would pulverize the peso again and bring it to trade for 50 US dollars.\par \par \uc2 On the eve of the presidential elections, a new \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis can drastically change the outlook. Macri knows that if he could control only one variable to keep his chances, this would be the price of the dollar: the historic Argentine monster, which is nothing more than the representation of fiscal problems and public spending that the country historically suffers.\par \par \uc2 As the rise did not perforate the roof of the 44, technically the BCRA could not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the direct market, but this does not mean that it has not operated in a different way to calm the waters. The tools that the entity has, commanded by \uc2 Guido Sandleris\uc2 , are the game of the interest rate and the \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the futures market. After the first movements there were slight setbacks in the demand that once again left the dollar below 41 pesos, but the worry continues.\par \par \uc2 For Amilcar Collante, from the Center for Economic Studies of the South, "the strategy of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  came in handy until January, with a controlled dollar and with a decrease in yields at the same time. Now he has no room for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , because with such a high ceiling in the non-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  area he has no possibility of action. "\par \par \uc2 The authorities know that they have reduced the amount of pesos available for them to take refuge in the North American \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but they are aware that uncertainty can increase demand at any time.\par \par \uc2 The Macri Government is betting that the harvest increase the income of dollars from the month of April and thus buy some peace to get fairly calm to the primary of August. \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  earnings for export of agricultural products are fundamental, since resorting to the rate and the carry trade for investors to come to the peso in the short term is, as the saying goes, "bread for today and hunger for tomorrow". With the rates through the clouds to control the exchange rate, credit is an impediment for SMEs and the economic teamsuffers the dilemma of the "short sheet".\par \par \uc2 "The reading is that Argentina is fragile. Your GDP per capita has fallen sharply with the megadevaluation and we will be in almost permanent review. We are emerging, but we continue pondering on the border given the institutional, economic and financial fragility, "warned Fernando Camusso of Rafaela Capital.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020190221ef2l006q2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
